Video2X Qt6 is the graphical user interface for Video2X, the machine
learning-based video super resolution and frame interpolation framework.

It queues up videos, GIFs and images, lets every task be configured
separately (processor, model, scaling factor, frame rate multiplier and
the encoder options) and reports the progress of the running job. The
processing itself is done by libvideo2x from the video2x port, so the
same Anime4K, Real-ESRGAN, Real-CUGAN and RIFE models are available.
